{"id":"7e1e039b5b31a7f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-jump.md","title":"Jump","display":"df-jump — Jump","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jump","aliases":["58-df-jump","Jump"],"display":"df-jump — Jump","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jump</span><span>Jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump — Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84ce8c835a688c6a\" href=\"?note=84ce8c835a688c6a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md\">../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,T,\\delta,t\\in V\">\\(X,T,\\delta,t\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84ce8c835a688c6a\" href=\"?note=84ce8c835a688c6a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md\">../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{JumpTimes}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{JumpTimes}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\delta,X,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\land t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\delta=X(t)-\\ell\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,t)\\;(t-\\eta&lt;s\\to|X(s)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\delta,X,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\land t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\delta=X(t)-\\ell\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,t)\\;(t-\\eta&lt;s\\to|X(s)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}times} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{JumpTimes}_S(T,X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\land\nT=\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}:\\exists\\delta\\neq0\\;\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\delta,X,t)\\}\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;|T\\cap(0,a]|\\leq\\aleph_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}times} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{JumpTimes}_S(T,X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\land\nT=\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}:\\exists\\delta\\neq0\\;\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\delta,X,t)\\}\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;|T\\cap(0,a]|\\leq\\aleph_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jump: discontinuity in a càdlàg path; the left limit is expanded by its real <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>--<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> condition instead of an undeclared limit operator.</li>\n<li>Lévy-Itô: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_t = X_0 + \\text{continuous martingale} + \\int_0^t \\int \\nu(ds,dz) + \\text{drift}\">\\(X_t = X_0 + \\text{continuous martingale} + \\int_0^t \\int \\nu(ds,dz) + \\text{drift}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Compound Poisson: sum of i.i.d. jumps at Poisson times; pure jump part</li>\n<li>Jump measure: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(dt,dz) = \\sum \\delta_{(T_i, \\Delta X_i)}\">\\(n(dt,dz) = \\sum \\delta_{(T_i, \\Delta X_i)}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A predictable compensator belongs to the theory of random measures and is not the pointwise conditional-expectation sum formerly asserted here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jacod and Shiryaev, Limit Theorems for Stochastic Processes</li>\n<li>Applebaum, Lévy Processes and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md","status":"resolved","id":"84ce8c835a688c6a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md","status":"resolved","id":"84ce8c835a688c6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,T,\\delta,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{JumpTimes}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\delta,X,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\land t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land\n\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\delta=X(t)-\\ell\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,t)\\;(t-\\eta<s\\to|X(s)-\\ell|<\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}times} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{JumpTimes}_S(T,X) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\land\nT=\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}:\\exists\\delta\\neq0\\;\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\delta,X,t)\\}\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;|T\\cap(0,a]|\\leq\\aleph_0","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"X_t = X_0 + \\text{continuous martingale} + \\int_0^t \\int \\nu(ds,dz) + \\text{drift}","display":false},{"tex":"n(dt,dz) = \\sum \\delta_{(T_i, \\Delta X_i)}","display":false}],"bytes":1707,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1bfc8cc22293797","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S$ (jump-size predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-jump.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-727","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-jump.md|58-df-jump]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["84ce8c835a688c6a"]}